DO $guard$ BEGIN IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$batch01$PT113-S4-Q16$batch01$ AND q.stimulus=$batch01$In determining the authenticity of a painting, connoisseurs claim to be guided by the emotional impact the work has on them. For example, if a painting purportedly by Rembrandt is expressive and emotionally moving in a certain way, then this is supposedly evidence that the work was created by Rembrandt himself, and not by one of his students. But the degree to which an artwork has an emotional impact differs wildly from person to person. So a connoisseur’s assessment cannot be given credence.$batch01$ AND q.prompt=$batch01$The reasoning in the argument is most vulnerable to criticism on the grounds that the argument$batch01$ AND q.correct_choice=$batch01$C$batch01$) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question changed: PT113-S4-Q16'; END IF; END $guard$;
